Go Digit General Insurance Ltd.
Section I: Loss of or Damage to the Vehicle Insured This section can be opted for either 1 Year or 2
Years or 3 Years or 4 years or 5 years.
Section II: Liability to Third Parties This section can be opted for either 1 Year or 2
Years or 3 Years or 4 years or 5 years.
Section III: Personal Accident Cover For Owner-Driver This section can be opted for either 1 Year or 2
Years or 3 Years or 4 years or 5 years.
Optional Covers under the Product: The policy term of the respective opted optional
cover can be 1 Year or 2 Years or 3 Years or 4
years or 5 years.
What are the perils/liabilities for which cover is provided in each of the three Sections?
SECTION I: LOSS OF OR DAMAGE TO THE VEHICLE INSURED
The Company will indemnify the insured against loss or damage to the vehicle insured hereunder and/or its
accessories whilst thereon
1. by fire explosion self-ignition or lightning;
2. by burglary housebreaking or theft;
3. by riot and strike;
4. by earthquake (fire and shock damage);
5. by flood typhoon hurricane storm tempest inundation cyclone hailstorm frost;
6. by accidental external means;
7. by malicious act;
8. by terrorist activity;
9. whilst in transit by road rail inland-waterway lift elevator or air;
10. by landslide rockslide
Subject to a deduction for depreciation at the rates mentioned below in respect of parts replaced:
1. For all rubber/nylon/plastic parts, tyres and tubes, batteries and air bags - 50%
2. For fibre glass components - 30%
3. For all parts made of glass - Nil
